  "title": "A clearer way to see new comments in work item view",
  "product": "Jira platform",
  "status": "released",
  "description": "This update introduces visual indicators for unread comments when new comments arrive while you are viewing a work item. You will now see a floating button and an unread dot to help you quickly spot new activity without needing to refresh the page. To see the new unread comment indicators in action: Open any work item in Jira.\n\tKeep the work item open while someone adds a new comment.\n\tIf the Activity panel is below your field of view on the screen, a floating button will appear to alert you to ",
